286:          <figure class="frame-card">
288:            <figcaption><span class="frame-card__t">3:05</span>The architecture in one frame: a lead crosses its boundary, the domain gate rejects the calls, and a worker with execution access takes over. The block is the route becoming visible.</figcaption>
291:          <figure class="frame-card">
293:            <figcaption><span class="frame-card__t">3:52</span><code>/toggle-workers</code> exposes the full ten-agent roster. Coordination sits on the stronger model tier; execution sits with specialist workers.</figcaption>
298:          <p class="move-label">4 · Name it — depth-2 delegation + zero micro-management</p>
299:          <h3>User → Orchestrator → leads → workers</h3>
