504:          <figure class="frame-card">
506:            <figcaption><span class="frame-card__t">23:40</span>Three storage layers are visible: the append-only team conversation, persistent per-agent sessions, and session-level work products. Expertise is the curated long-lived layer, not a transcript dump.</figcaption>
