-        <a class="button" href="vol-3-ma/16-lead-agents.html">Start chapter →</a>
+        <p class="eyebrow">Now available · Volume III · Lesson 17</p>
+        <h2>Infinite UI Agents</h2>
+        <p class="chapter-feature__dek">Own the harness that turns one intent into parallel, brand-aware, validated Vue variants—and compounds agent expertise after every run.</p>
